{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Keep 10-year Long Residence Route for people already living in the UK",
        "additional_details": "Retain the 10-Year Long Residence Route and stop any retrospective application of the government\u2019s proposed changes to ILR to those already living on the UK who are on the Long Residence route.",
        "background": "Retain the 10-year Long Residence settlement route at least for those on the route living in the UK since 2021. Many came following the representation that they would qualify for ILR after 10 years. We believe replacing the Long Residence route and its existing rules would be a breach of contract.",
